  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Reduced commercial traffic through key maritime chokepoints forces rerouting, longer sail times, port congestion and higher insurance/transport costs, which delays and degrades the throughput of transport and distribution networks used to move equipment and supplies into the Ukraine theatre.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_confront</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
