  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in perceived oil-supply disruption risk prompts consumer states, Gulf intermediaries, and multilateral actors to intensify diplomatic outreach and mediation efforts to defuse US–Iran tensions that threaten regional stability and markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
