  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in global oil prices boosts export revenue and near‑term fiscal space for hydrocarbon exporters (notably Russia), enabling higher recruitment, maintenance and procurement that increase available combat‑capable personnel and platforms over the medium term.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_confront</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
