  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in oil prices raises near‑term inflation expectations and the likelihood of tighter monetary policy, which is priced into markets as higher nominal government bond yields.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
