  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in US long‑term yields raise federal interest costs and create near‑term fiscal pressure that prompts cuts or delays in forward‑deployed forces and allied burden‑sharing commitments, causing allied governments to doubt US reliability and reducing cohesion.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
