  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in US government bond yields raises near‑term debt service costs and domestic fiscal pressure, producing political incentives to scale back or slow costly foreign diplomatic initiatives and high‑level engagement on the Israel region.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_debt_bond_stress</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_region_escalation</data>
</edge>
